    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pandora\u2019s Box has been opened, and it\u2019s up to you to survive the relentless waves of alien invaders! <i>Pandora's Doom: Apocalypse Hotline</i> is an action-packed tower defense game where you must build your defenses and fight off hordes of extraterrestrial creatures. Deploy a variety of turrets, fortify your base, and manage your resources wisely to withstand increasingly difficult waves. Adapt your strategy, defeat the alien threat, and become humanity\u2019s last hope!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pandora\u2019s Box has been opened, and it\u2019s up to you to survive the relentless waves of alien invaders! <i>Pandora's Doom: Apocalypse Hotline</i> is an action-packed tower defense game where you must build your defenses and fight off hordes of extraterrestrial creatures. Deploy a variety of turrets, fortify your base, and manage your resources wisely to withstand increasingly difficult waves. Adapt your strategy, defeat the alien threat, and become humanity\u2019s last hope!</p>",
